{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0002", "hash": "sha256:d7dfb0d54898301534c0eadfcb34c51486c98fa29e87e3b090451154b75269f7", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 300674, "byte_start": 300540, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:6e947b003dcaeb714f336c2b9789fd2f1881f4320c5bd3f13b90746dc2c45243", "line_end": 7916, "line_start": 7914}, "owner_tag": "04R5", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, x) \\to (S, s)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:400a734749aa0d2c8a10fadd4525f88950ddaeaff5328c6cebc711dfb6ec4850", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:56183d29b5ad0092e5837a57d2e3e8433e04fe9d5509c7c442cb49740092c7b1", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nA morphism of germs <MATH_0001> determines a well defined\nmap of local rings. Hence the following lemma makes sense.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9b5277b2f889c97e43516cfb1341955fdf2bdb7db0b03c84197e848a78022483", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:d4c2219df4d7a4e58a72ed03932537fe5e0f720e3473c373b8e226c6509fb2c5", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302278, "byte_start": 300905, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:41b2b273cda41f25189f7193a98ec24e3d6ec68d65188831bab5f3b923365067", "line_end": 7966, "line_start": 7928}, "owner_tag": "04ND", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'} & \\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\ar[l] \\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_{U, u} \\ar[u] & \\mathcal{O}_{V, v} \\ar[l] \\ar[u]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$R = \\mathcal{O}_{V, v}$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "MATH_0004": "$M = \\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-section-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-permanence}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-base-change}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-map-between-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1e5df2742906c484091061786a8ec60719d996300cc615831946e7402453d1d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f03fd9da1ef7390b82168047380d5b546484fee16c8b5485f5723b7618ad7cd0", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain the following diagram of local homomorphisms of local rings\n<MATH_0001>\nNote that the vertical arrows are localizations of <ACCENT_0001>tale ring maps,\nin particular they are essentially of finite presentation, flat,\nand unramified (see\nAlgebra, Section <REF_0002>).\nIn particular the vertical maps are faithfully flat, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nNow, if the upper horizontal arrow is flat, then the lower horizontal\narrow is flat by an application of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>\nwith <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> and\n<MATH_0004>. If the lower horizontal arrow is\nflat, then the ring map\n<MATH_0005>\nis flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0005>.\nAnd the ring map\n<MATH_0006>\nis a localization of a map between <ACCENT_0002>tale ring extensions of\n<MATH_0007>, hence flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e27a9deb163d99016b54ef5c013390ecd27fe38fbb12228489f2a78e906aa968", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04ND:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:26a9ee296ad2bb078f681a52b645ee5e3371d0b85901b623ff21222c9fadc136", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 300903, "byte_start": 300676, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:c9d9373d2253619872fe7fa3bf8c90623ca635c44f85046a0f13bee6af4d39cd", "line_end": 7926, "line_start": 7918}, "owner_tag": "04ND", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "math_text_regions": [{"delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}], "region_id": "math/0001", "slots": [{"boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"anchor": {"file": "descent.tex", "kind": "lemma", "matches": [{"command_byte_span": {"end": 300845, "start": 300830}, "command_hash": "sha256:828805d88327151a6ec2ef49fc14ab616f9885ede8613def76d19e416efc81b0", "container_byte_span": {"end": 300903, "start": 300676}, "container_hash": "sha256:c9d9373d2253619872fe7fa3bf8c90623ca635c44f85046a0f13bee6af4d39cd"}], "ordinal": 1, "owner_label": "descent-lemma-flat-at-point", "owner_tag": "04ND", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:2762bd3987f6da68e373928da96eb653423d86d2bb52a1fb1599c98eec53a4ff", "source_label": "descent-lemma-flat-at-point", "usage": "root-condition", "usage_source": {"after": "\n$", "before": "}", "environments": []}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "descent-is-flat", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 91, "start": 83}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": " is flat"}], "source": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}((X, x) \\to (S, s)) =\n\\mathcal{O}_{S, s} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}\\text{ is flat}\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 172, "start": 77}, "source_hash": "sha256:afaf38157243cc85e256008c89654c76a0ba1ae58bba85324793e7cc445d09b1"}], "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-flat-at-point}", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}((X, x) \\to (S, s)) =\n\\mathcal{O}_{S, s} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5272af4057901a83918ab9e95363e49e0c3c40e6018b18854ca0cc5fb3bb2044", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:27f242184566faca35fd013a2f535e17497ae5a079620d03026e021a68e0be63", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:79110d66220eaad1bc7e99ce423c9c23bd00a70828342d63b56a0d576fc31c34", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nThe property of morphisms of germs\n<MATHSEG_0001> is flat<MATHSEG_0002>\nis <ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:22628b94a5f711cb5962936808cd59ea26a9ea8db0e2d31ef0e299f89812ce70", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04ND:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NI:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:b33a172544456e6e17153c32ed2e3279fa9342dfd310f60cbff4244e4a14af19", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302586, "byte_start": 302280, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:86f2e1be7acb9d7fe758e8a6edd79b7d1780e922aadd909888fdeacc11efb0d5", "line_end": 7979, "line_start": 7968}, "owner_tag": "04NI", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-etale-on-fiber}", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU' \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & V' \\ar[d] \\\\\nU \\ar[r] & V\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$v' \\in V'$", "MATH_0003": "$v \\in V$", "MATH_0004": "$U'_{v'} \\to U_v$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:413141d7c4fa397c1a9abb4922a58a6d5e6e3af0ca196b0ad34bf64b2808576c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e35128470d000233c1ff768497bbc3b44143435a38810e4e5f2d02d6902c1ba0", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nConsider a commutative diagram of morphisms of schemes\n<MATH_0001>\nwith <ACCENT_0001>tale vertical arrows and a point <MATH_0002> mapping to <MATH_0003>.\nThen the morphism of fibres <MATH_0004> is <ACCENT_0002>tale.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c5191c3e05f2f3338e5d1b5917d98e036b417376f3b3e07c64b77c327c06d46", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NI:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-lemma-flat-base-change", "hash": "sha256:18b2c4cb6246e648dd58aaa2a826a3bb348f1f4a40692cab2bb1729bcf23b461", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 317639, "byte_start": 317446, "file": "algebra.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:add8c7e208bee65edac1bf22e09adb4320be43a378a1790d686b3d78f8af1db2", "line_end": 8892, "line_start": 8888}, "owner_tag": "00HI", "parent_tag": "00H9", "requested_label": "algebra-lemma-flat-base-change", "requested_tag": "00HI", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebra", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "00H9", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-flat-base-change}", "MATH_0001": "$M$", "MATH_0002": "$R$", "MATH_0003": "$R \\to R'$", "MATH_0004": "$M \\otimes_R R'$", "MATH_0005": "$R'$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:06fca884640f112439b4e345800a9238c7d1e62e0363bd94e815bfc8049e99c9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3f88b25623348101a1b7631f8876530f237c0f3307bfb65dc11288eb13822c5d", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nSuppose that <MATH_0001> is (faithfully) flat over <MATH_0002>, and that <MATH_0003>\nis a ring map. Then <MATH_0004> is (faithfully) flat over <MATH_0005>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:da320bcf735ce3c807cd4000bbceebe59d4b21362b3e333ade2eeda62702514f", "unit_id": "inventory:algebra:00HI:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-lemma-flat-permanence", "hash": "sha256:408d272ce333d4334029752f26bb24ea607556cf479fc3e1bb86446f1d193f77", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 320185, "byte_start": 319981, "file": "algebra.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:2363791f7dc8bfa667d55298df45716ab0924bc34928479011483a6f327e4411", "line_end": 8962, "line_start": 8957}, "owner_tag": "039V", "parent_tag": "00H9", "requested_label": "algebra-lemma-flat-permanence", "requested_tag": "039V", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebra", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "00H9", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-flat-permanence}", "MATH_0001": "$R \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$M$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$M$", "MATH_0005": "$R$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$R \\to S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f754da4d1387c7e47907025134f24767125f7793c8a07009346d29f037b891cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:db9fd3765c9f6b2fc5698994311bad66cc32e0606879ccb06516c6192ae4204f", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a ring map. Let <MATH_0002> be an <MATH_0003>-module.\nIf <MATH_0004> is flat as an <MATH_0005>-module and faithfully flat as an <MATH_0006>-module,\nthen <MATH_0007> is flat.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:176cb79192940a132dd93b48c2ad5fbae45931702d8efea984903cb783747af9", "unit_id": "inventory:algebra:039V:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff", "hash": "sha256:c93cd34f910f4dec443eb20634d2dfcb9b6ed6f1da3ef3774afadafde8c9584a", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 327541, "byte_start": 327422, "file": "algebra.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:158f1f500e185803b46999692b2b5c6ee48da3cbe17fad315e861d26b17a132d", "line_end": 9186, "line_start": 9183}, "owner_tag": "00HR", "parent_tag": "00H9", "requested_label": "algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff", "requested_tag": "00HR", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebra", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "00H9", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-local-flat-ff}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:40cbab38d4dec51aa653517c0bcc80088c658f7a95894a091a723bc20ab8c38e", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nA flat local ring homomorphism of local rings is faithfully flat.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3c8b6373245d61b7c65467d4c32818621a5c06184b785090809d5601693dc274", "unit_id": "inventory:algebra:00HR:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-lemma-map-between-etale", "hash": "sha256:f09de024ec13db2866fe203fc8577195f516c7beb985b683c13820daced82eda", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 1447752, "byte_start": 1447606, "file": "algebra.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:5dc4ba72a1bd4e72ac66b53502fc7a3af34af63410f79bbfcdf1a43f41a1fffc", "line_end": 39511, "line_start": 39507}, "owner_tag": "00U7", "parent_tag": "00U0", "requested_label": "algebra-lemma-map-between-etale", "requested_tag": "00U7", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebra", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "00U0", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-map-between-etale}", "MATH_0001": "$R \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$R \\to S'$", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$S' \\to S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2a21054f016800db44f7f0475a7f8d0a4f531df01c47eb1085da713b1ff98369", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d6373d80195d9c58d9d84a0dc3ae7e2aa500919a296e6ecd16adc4460f43759c", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be <ACCENT_0001>tale.\nThen any <MATH_0003>-algebra map <MATH_0004> is <ACCENT_0002>tale.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e0034d55e94f8181f5c6cc2d8691a055ddfc4809aab686abd2117bd17eed9a44", "unit_id": "inventory:algebra:00U7:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-section-etale", "hash": "sha256:bce9638f45ed7b965f71360aaa94ab4b9ca84992d3f31feb93e09482f2c46437", "value": {"kind": "locked-Engl